## 7. Adapter 4：发车确认 / 任务中车辆卡片 -> PendingTaskStepItem

文件：`components/VehicleDetail/vehicleInfoCard.adapter.ts`

这条线不是 `RouteItem`，而是服务于新的车辆详情卡片 `VehicleInfoCardNew` 内部的步骤条模型 `PendingTaskStepItem`。

```ts
export interface PendingTaskStepItem {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  eta: string;
  badge: string;
  badgeType: 'start' | 'mid' | 'end';
  isLast: boolean;
  isPassed: boolean;
  showArrow: boolean;
  pointStatus?: TaskStepStatus;
  lineStatus?: TaskStepStatus;
  arrowPosition?: TaskStepArrowPosition;
  showEta?: boolean;
}
```

### 7.1 发车前：静态路线

```ts
export const buildPendingTaskSteps = (
  stopoverPointListArray?: StopOverPointInfo[][]
): PendingTaskStepItem[] => {
  const merged = [fixedStartPoint, ...getTaskRoutePoints(stopoverPointListArray)];
  const arrowPointIndex = 0;

  return merged.map((item, idx) => {
    const isFirst = idx === 0;
    const isLast = idx === merged.length - 1;

    return {
      id: String(item.staId || idx),
      name: item.staName || '',
      eta: item.eta || '',
      badge: isFirst ? '起' : isLast ? '终' : `${idx}`,
      badgeType: isFirst ? 'start' : isLast ? 'end' : 'mid',
      isLast,
      isPassed: false,
      showArrow: idx === arrowPointIndex,
      pointStatus: 'pending',
      lineStatus: isLast ? undefined : 'pending',
      arrowPosition: idx === arrowPointIndex ? 'point' : 'none',
      showEta: false,
    };
  });
};
```

发车前没有真实执行状态，所以只展示规划路线：起点 + 任务点 + 返程点，箭头停在起点。

### 7.2 发车后：动态路线

```ts
export const buildStartedTaskSteps = (
  stopoverPointListArray?: StopOverPointInfo[][],
  fulfillmentTaskNodeDTOS?: FulfillmentTaskNodeDTO[],
  transportInfo?: TransportDetail
): PendingTaskStepItem[] => {
  const merged = getTaskRoutePoints(stopoverPointListArray);
  const fulfillmentNodes = fulfillmentTaskNodeDTOS || [];
  const routeSource = merged.length
    ? [fixedStartPoint, ...merged]
    : fulfillmentNodes.map((item) => {
      const detail = item?.stopoverPointDetailInfoDTO;
      return {
        eta: detail?.eta,
        staId: detail?.staId,
        staName: detail?.title || detail?.staName || '',
        type: detail?.type,
      } as StopOverPointInfo;
    });

  if (!routeSource.length) return [];

  const routeProgress = resolveStartedRouteProgress(
    routeSource,
    fulfillmentNodes,
    transportInfo
  );

  return routeSource.map((item, idx) => {
    const isFirst = idx === 0;
    const isLast = idx === routeSource.length - 1;
    const matchedNode = findFulfillmentNode(fulfillmentNodes, item, idx);
    const status = buildStepStatus(idx, routeProgress, isLast);

    return {
      id: String(item.staId || item.utpAutoportId || idx),
      name: item.staName || '',
      eta: getPointEta(matchedNode, transportInfo, item),
      badge: isFirst ? '起' : isLast ? '终' : `${idx}`,
      badgeType: isFirst ? 'start' : isLast ? 'end' : 'mid',
      isLast,
      isPassed: status.lineStatus === 'done',
      showArrow: status.arrowPosition !== 'none',
      showEta: true,
      ...status,
    };
  });
};
```

这里处理了两种输入：

- 如果页面还有 `stopoverPointListArray`，优先基于本地路线源展示。
- 如果刷新后本地路线源没了，用后端 `fulfillmentTaskNodeDTOS` 兜底恢复。

这和发车成功后独立 `TaskProgress` 页面“刷新状态不丢”的设计是配套的。

### 7.3 车辆卡片中使用

`vehicleInfoCard.tsx`：

```ts
const pendingTaskSteps = buildPendingTaskSteps(stopoverPointListArray);
const startedTaskSteps = buildStartedTaskSteps(
  stopoverPointListArray,
  fulfillmentTaskNodeDTOS,
  transportInfo
);
const routeSteps = isTaskStarted ? startedTaskSteps : pendingTaskSteps;
```

然后统一渲染：

```tsx
{routeSteps.map((step) => (
  <div className="nvc__step" key={step.id}>
    ...
    <span className="nvc__step-name">{step.name}</span>
    {step.showEta && step.eta && (
      <span className="nvc__step-eta">{step.eta}</span>
    )}
  </div>
))}
```

这也是 Adapter 模式：组件不关心发车前 / 发车后数据差异，只关心 `routeSteps`。

